#: ../userguides/custom_pipelines.rst:1 620b9899fb474883a69469ce932d4029
msgid ""
"Custom Mapflow AI models trained for specific objects and imagery, and "
"connected to your account on request."
msgstr "Mapflow 定制 AI 模型针对特定对象和影像训练，可应要求接入您的账户。"

#: ../userguides/custom_pipelines.rst:7 9c5b1d84c82e4beda4e45fea51fab731
msgid "Custom models"
msgstr "定制模型"

#: ../userguides/custom_pipelines.rst:11 3e0b19de781543529b41acc860adcaaf
msgid ""
"Custom models are trained for specific objects and imagery. They run in the "
"same Mapflow workflows as the default models once we connect them to your "
"account."
msgstr "定制模型针对特定对象和影像训练。接入您的账户后，它们与默认模型在相同的 Mapflow 工作流中运行。"

#: ../userguides/custom_pipelines.rst:14 a8f835d066674331b8ea32ae6aa52383
msgid "There are three ways to get one:"
msgstr "获取定制模型有三种方式："

#: ../userguides/custom_pipelines.rst:16 cd9632c107aa4d5492103ea1cf40d519
msgid ""
"**Request a model we already have.** Pick one below and we connect it to "
"your account."
msgstr "**申请现有模型。** 从下方选择一个模型，我们会将其接入您的账户。"

#: ../userguides/custom_pipelines.rst:17 0914a763e08d4e53a93fe4c3730438b5
msgid ""
"**Test a pre-trained model.** Try a model that is not in the standard list "
"on your area and decide whether it fits or needs more training."
msgstr "**试用预训练模型。** 在您的区域试用不在标准列表中的模型，判断它是否适用或需要进一步训练。"

#: ../userguides/custom_pipelines.rst:19 dbb57595155e4f828a54fa90c0a43e13
msgid ""
"**Bring your own model.** Train it on your data and we connect it to the "
"Mapflow workflow engine."
msgstr "**使用您自己的模型。** 用您的数据训练模型，我们会将其接入 Mapflow 工作流引擎。"

#: ../userguides/custom_pipelines.rst:21 c4d98e7102b344a0bd11072737e133a5
